<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-11797] Fix consistency issues for atomic and mixed tx-atomic cache groups.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-11797</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10078&quot; title=&quot;Node failure during concurrent partition updates may cause partition desync between primary and backup.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-10078&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-10078&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; only solves consistency problems for tx mode.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;For atomic caches the rebalance consistency issues still remain and should be fixed together with improvement of atomic cache protocol consistency.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also, need to disable dynamic start of atomic cache in group having only tx caches because it&apos;s not working in current state.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
